                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "When this enchantment enters, target opponent discards a card and you lose 2 life.\nSacrifice this enchantment: Choose one —\n• Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.\n• Creatures you control gain hexproof until end of turn. (They can’t be the targets of spells or abilities your opponents control.){flavor}Maelle: If you’re gonna give someone flowers, you should probably do it before they wither and die.\nGustave: What? The flower? Or Sophie?\nMaelle: Ooh dark. Sophie would approve.",
