                    "text": "{i}Performs a silencing combo{/i} — {2}{W}, {T}: Target creature an opponent controls loses all abilities until end of turn.\n{i}Protects its allies{/i} — {3}{W}, {T}: Put a shield counter on target creature you control.\n{i}Performs a weakening strike{/i} — {1}{B}, {T}: Target creature an opponent controls gets -1/-1 until end of turn.\n{i}Applies rage on its allies{/i} — {1}{B}, {T}: Untap target creature you control.\nWhen this creature dies, target opponent creates a Lumina token.",
