                },
                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "{i}Projects disturbing Chroma{/i} — Hexproof, indestructible\nAt the beginning your upkeep, Clea Unleashed loses hexproof and indestructible until end of turn.\n{i}Summons Nevrons{/i} — At the beginning of your upkeep, choose one —\n• Search your library for a Nevron card and put it onto the battlefield.\n• Create a token that’s a copy of target nonlegendary Nevron creature you control, except it has haste. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.",
                    "x": 0.086,
                    "y": 0.6303,
