                    "text": "Double strike\nDualliste’s power and toughness are each equal to 3 plus the number of Blood tokens you control.\n{i}Stormblood{/i} — Whenever Dualliste deals combat damage, create a Blood token.\n{i}Applies Inverted{/i} — {B}{B}, Sacrifice a Blood token: Target creature has base toughness 1 until end of turn.",
