                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Target creature deals 3 damage to itself.{flavor}Damn you Esquie and your stupid mushrooms. Your friend ate them with no problem but it also seems your friend was immortal! That’s the sort of extremely relevant detail that you should mention at the start. Ugh, stop crying! You’re not the one about to die.\n- Marcel, Expedition 66",
