                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "Return target creature to its owner’s hand. You gain 3 life.\nCreate a Lumina token. (It’s an artifact with “{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Scry 1.”){flavor}Sciel: It was you. You saved me. Back then. Wait, but how?\nEsquie: I heard your tears. \nSciel: From so far away?\nEsquie: I heard you, so I came.",
