                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "{W}{U}, {T}: Target noncreature artifact becomes a copy of target creature until end of turn, except it is an artifact in addition to its other types.\nWhen this creature dies, create a Chroma token.{flavor}I just finished my sculpture of the legendary Esquie. This may be my life’s finest work, yet not a single soul seems to care. How could I make it better?",
