                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "Whenever this creature attacks, it gets +3/-3 until end of turn.\nWhen this creature dies, create a Chroma token.{flavor}The trick is finding that perfect point where your nerves have calmed enough that your mind and body are one, but not so calm that your reactions are dulled. Some of the lads haven’t quite managed riding that edge, but I remain in full control of my body and thoughts!",
