                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "Whenever a Nevron creature dies, create a Food token.\n{2}, Sacrifice a Food token: Target non-Nevron creature deals 3 damage to itself.\nWhen this creature dies, create a Chroma token.{flavor}I can’t believe she convinced everyone to eat the Nevron. They’ve been puking for the past few hours. Great.\n- Julien, Expedition 59",
