                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "This creature can’t be blocked except by creatures with flying.\nWhen this creature dies, create a Chroma token.{flavor}I still remember the first mountain we scaled. Watching the sun rise above the clouds was magical. But rappelling down as we set the handholds was pure exhilaration.\n- Fleur, Expedition 69",
