                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "When this creature enters, you may search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\nWhenever this creature attacks, surveil 1.\nWhen this creature dies, create a Chroma token.{flavor}It may not be glamorous, but truly essential work rarely is. Doesn’t make it any less important.\n- Fleur, Expedition 69",
