                    "oneLine": true,
                    "font": "belerenb",
                    "size": 0.0324
                },
                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "Whenever a creature you control becomes the target of a spell or ability, you may put a quest counter on this enchantment.\n{i}Normal Difficulty{/i} — As long as this enchantment has three or more quest counters on it, whenever a creature you control becomes the target of a spell or ability, draw a card.\n{i}Hard Difficulty{/i} — {U/R}{U/R}: You may choose new targets for target spell or ability. Activate this ability only if this enchantment has five or more quest counters on it.{flavor}Oh, you won. You deserve this reward. Have fun with it!",
                    "x": 0.086,
                    "y": 0.6303,
                    "width": 0.828,
                    "height": 0.2875,
                    "size": 0.0362
