                    "size": 0.0324
                },
                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "Flash. Ward {2}. Reach.\n{i}Grows Flowers{/i} — At the beginning of your upkeep, create a Flower token (It’s an artifact with “{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add {U}, {R} or {G}.”)\n{i}Absorbs Flowers{/i} — Whenever a Flower token leaves the battlefield, choose one —\n• Goblu deals 1 damage to any target.\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\n• Put a shield counter on target creature.\n• Draw a card.{flavor}Gustave, wait! It seems peaceful, as long as we don’t touch the flowers.\n- Lune",
                    "x": 0.086,
                    "y": 0.6303,
                    "width": 0.828,
                    "height": 0.2875,
                    "size": 0.0362
                },
