                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "{i}Covers her sword in blood{/i} — {X}{B}, {T}, Exert this creature: This creature deals X damage to target creature. This creature gets -0/-X until end of turn. Put a shield counter on this creature.\n{i}Is about to jump{/i} — {1}{W}: This creature gains flying until end of turn. This creature has base toughness 1 until end of turn. Put a shield counter on this creature.\nWhen this creature dies, target opponent creates a Lumina token. (It’s an artifact with “{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Scry 1.”)",
