                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "Whenever Gustave becomes untapped, attacks or blocks, put a charge counter on him.\n{i}From Fire{/i} — {W}{R},{T}: Gustave deals 3 damage to target creature, you gain 3 life.\n{i}Strike Storm{/i} — {W}{R}: Gustave gains double-strike until end of turn, put two charge counters on him. Activate only once per turn.\n{i}Overcharge{/i} — {T}, Remove X charge counters from Gustave: Gustave deals X damage to target creature and that creature’s controller.{flavor}For those who come after.",
                    "x": 0.086,
                    "y": 0.6325515280739161,
