                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "When Letter from Alicia enters, scry 2.\nWhen Letter from Alicia is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, creatures can’t attack this turn.\n{2}, Sacrifice Letter from Alicia: Draw a card.{flavor}Brother, I tire of the conflicts and deceptions that plague our family and theirs. So I entrust you with this letter. Whether you give it to her is up to you.",
