                },
                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a verse counter on this land.\n{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}, Remove two verse counters from this land: Expeditioner creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.{flavor}Maybe when this is over, we can fix up the opera house and you can perform for us. I want my first concert to be yours. And don’t worry, I’ll make sure the room is packed. I’ll put up posters everywhere in town.\n- Maelle",
                    "x": 0.086,
                    "y": 0.6325515280739161,
                    "width": 0.828,
