                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "{i}Stance Switch{/i} — At the beginning of combat, roll a six-sided die.\n1-2 | {i}Offensive Stance{/i} — Maelle gains Vigilance and +2/+0 until your next turn\n3-4 | {i}Defensive Stance{/i} — Maelle gains Hexproof, First Strike and +0/+2 until your next turn.\n5-6 | {i}Virtuose Stance{/i} — Maelle gains Double Strike and +1/-1 until your next turn.\nAt the beginning of your end step, if you both own and control Maelle, Child of Lumière and a creature named Alicia Dessendre, Silenced by Fire, exile them, then meld them into Maelle, The Reawakened Paintress.",
                    "x": 0.086,
