                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "{T}, Sacrifice a Chroma token: Draw a card.\nWhen this creature dies, create a Chroma token.{flavor}I know, how about showing me a dance of love and sorrow? I am also the official painter of the Opera. Will you help me? If you inspire me, you may become the main painting of Lumière’s Opera.",
