                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "Whenever Osquio deals damage to a creature, create a blue Aura enchantment token named Barbapapa attached to that creature. The token has enchant creature and “Enchanted creature has base power 1. When enchanted creature deals combat damage, sacrifice this Aura.”\nWhenever a creature dies, untap Osquio.\n{i}Goes pew pew pew{/i} — {R}, {T}: Osquio deals 2 damage to any target.\n{i}Decides to destroy the world. Bye bye{/i} — When Osquio dies, destroy all permanents unless a player pays {6}.{flavor}Prepare to be HUGGED.",
