                },
                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "Fear\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, create a Chroma token.\n{i}Summons Dark Beast{/i} — When Painted Renoir enters and at the beginning of your upkeep, you may create Dark Chromatic Beast, a legendary 4/4 black Nevron Beast creature with Trample and Lifelink.\nPainted Renoir has indestructible as long as you control a token named Dark Chromatic Beast.\n{i}Sends waves of Chroma{/i} — {B}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice X Chromas: Up to two target creatures each get -X/-X until end of turn.{flavor}I love them too.",
                    "x": 0.086,
                    "y": 0.6303,
                    "width": 0.828,
                    "height": 0.2875,
                    "size": 0.0362
                },
