                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "This spell costs {1} less to cast if you control a Gestral.\n{i}Attacks with its mighty sword{/i} — {2}{R}, {T}: This creature deals 1 damage to target creature, put a stun counter on it.\n{i}Gestral Volleyball{/i} — {1}{R}, Sacrifice a Gestral: This creature deals 2 damage to any target.\nWhen this creature dies, target opponent creates a Lumina token.\nWhen this creature dies, you may have this creature deal 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two or three target creatures.",
