                },
                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "Each nonland card in your hand without foretell has foretell. Its foretell cost is equal to its mana cost reduced by {2}.\nWhenever you foretell a card, you gain 2 life.\n{i}Twilight Slash{/i} - {W}{B},{T}: Sciel deals 2 damage to target creature, you gain 2 life.\n{i}Intervention{/i} - {W}{W},{T}: Untap target creature. Create a Chroma token.\n{i}Our Sacrifice{/i} - {1}{B}{B}, {T}, Pay X life: Up to two target creatures each get -X/-X until end of turn.{flavor}Death is a friend who will welcome me home",
                    "x": 0.086,
                    "y": 0.6325515280739161,
                    "width": 0.828,
                    "height": 0.27149964463397297,
