                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "Trample, Double Strike\nSimon enters with a foreboding counter.\n{i}The dead are removed from the canvas{/i} — If a creature would be put into a graveyard from anywhere, exile it instead.\n{i}Gathers Chroma{/i} — {B}{B}, {T}: Target creature has base toughness 1 until end of turn.\n{i}The Expedition is removed from the canvas{/i} — {T}, Remove a foreboding counter from Simon: Choose a creature an opponent controls. Exile all creatures except for Simon and the chosen creature.",
