                    "text": "{i}Picto Reinforcement{/i} — {2}{U}, {T}: Create two Lumina tokens.\n{i}Upgrades your weapons{/i} — {2}{WG}, {T}: Distribute two +1/+1 counters among one or two target creatures.\n{i}Latent skill activation{/i} — {3}{B}, {T}, Exert a tapped Expeditioner creature you control: Destroy target creature.\nWhen The Curator dies, return it to the battlefield transformed under it’s owner’s control.{flavor}Lune: What is he?\nMaelle: I’m not sure, he doesn’t really talk.",
