                    "text": "When The Gingerbread Door enters, each player creates a Food token.\nCreatures with power greater than the number of Foods on the battlefield can’t attack.\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: You gain 3 life.{flavor}A group of five? A yummy looking cake! We have what is needed. NOW LET’S PARTYYYYY-",
