                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "{i}Void Meteors{/i} — {B}{R}, {T}: The Paintress deals 3 damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures and/or planeswalkers.\n{i}Rips apart reality{/i} — {2}{U}, {T}: Up to two target nonland permanents phase out.\n{i}Heals an Expeditioner{/i} — {W}{G}, {T}: You gain 1 life for each Expeditioner you control.\nWhen The Paintress dies, return it to the battlefield transformed under it’s owner’s control.{flavor}Arrogant Man. I taught him to Paint. And he seeks to use my creations against me?",
