                },
                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "Reach, trample\nThe Reacher enters with seven sky counters.\nThe Reacher cannot attack or block while it has one or more sky counters.\nWhenever a creature you control with flying attacks, remove a sky counter from The Reacher.\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}.\n{2}{G/U}: Remove a sky counter from The Reacher.{flavor}Little one, there’s more to life, if you can just see how big the sky truly is. Reach out your hand, and it’s yours...",
                    "x": 0.086,
                    "y": 0.6303,
                    "width": 0.828,
                    "height": 0.27398720682302774,
