                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "Look at the top three cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.\nYou gain 3 life.\n{i}Luminous{/i} — If you control three or more Lumina tokens, create two 1/1 Human Expeditioner tokens with “When this creature dies, create a Chroma token.”",
