                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "This spell costs {1} less to cast if you control a Gestral.\nThis creature enters with a shield counter.\n{i}Strikes with its dead partner{/i} — {2}, Sacrifice a Nevron: This creature deals damage equal to the sacrificed Nevron’s mana value to target creature.\n{i}Slams its shield{/i} — {R}{R}, {T}, Remove a shield counter from this creature: This creature deals 4 damage to any target.\nWhen this creature dies, target opponent creates a Lumina token.{flavor}INTRUDER ALERT! INTRUDER ALERT! Send forth the ULTIMATE WEAPON!\n- Tropa",
