                "rules": {
                    "name": "Rules Text",
                    "text": "As this enchantment enters, choose a creature type.\nWhenever a creature you control of the chosen type enters, target creature you control of the chosen type with greater mana value gains haste until end of turn.\nWhenever two or more creatures of the chosen type attacks, they each get +1/+0 until end of turn.{flavor}Verso traded his life for yours. I both love and hate him for that. That damn fool.\n- Clea",
